Replace-Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 06:24:11 +0800
Subject: dt-bindings: sound: document the Hi3716CV200 audio blocks

The Hi3716CV200 carries the same AIAO register bands as the Hi3798MV100
and adds the TianLai internal audio DAC, two registers next to the CRG
with no source select of their own.

The two AIAO bindings gain the strings this chip uses and the DAC gets a
schema of its own naming the CRG gate and reset cells; the card binding
grows the DAC links, with a capture link that taps the same transmit
port the DAC listens to so that port's output can be measured without an
analog probe.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
 3 files changed, 134 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/hisilicon,hi3716cv200-adac.yaml


